scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"30445","synopsis":"Marii ends up having to prove that she's not a cross dressing boy. Later, the girls visit Asakusa where they try their hand at some fortunes. This leads the girls to discuss why Tetora has such great luck and always seems to avoid danger.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vh7z0imKK1oA8tGonEk1aiJTOMa.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Marii ends up having to prove that she's not a cross dressing boy. Later, the girls visit Asakusa where they try their hand at some fortunes. This leads the girls to discuss why Tetora has such great luck and always seems to avoid danger.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vh7z0imKK1oA8tGonEk1aiJTOMa.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8899","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"12679","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"12679","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79040","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"259651","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"30452","synopsis":"As Gankyou exhibits some violent behavior, the girls discuss the stereotypes that come when a girl wears glasses. Later, as Kukuru gets trainsick, the girls try to come up with various ailments for her. Afterwards, on the night of a full moon, the girls sit and discuss moon-related topics before being attacked by a large rabbit.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2j20xVA4pImYzZjlHFZnVboT1kv.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"As Gankyou exhibits some violent behavior, the girls discuss the stereotypes that come when a girl wears glasses. Later, as Kukuru gets trainsick, the girls try to come up with various ailments for her. Afterwards, on