ressing room somehow leads to the girls deciding to act like delinquents so they will marry early. Later, the girls get up early to go to a fish market. Afterwards, the girls search for things that might be using up electricity, becoming oblivious to the non-electric horrors hidden throughout the room.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xy0HNuyt03iqM2URdD6Qrkmabgd.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8899","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"12679","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"12679","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79040","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"259651","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"30449","synopsis":"Marii laments how she's always the last to go in various things, particularly when it comes to picking out envelopes of New Year's money. Later, the girls head to the Sugamo district and check out the various spots. Afterwards, the gang needlessly worry that Kukuru might contract the May Blues, randomly choosing to take on \"Blues\" from other months.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pQJfuG7rIIK3r9Oy4Z0ZEcmQziR.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Marii laments how she's always the last to go in various things, particularly when it comes to picking out envelopes of New Year's money. Later, the girls head to the Sugamo district and check out the various spots. Afterwards, the gang needlessly worry that Kukuru might contract the May Blues, randomly choosing to take on \"Blues\" from other months.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pQJfuG7rIIK3r9Oy4Z0ZEcmQziR.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8899","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"12679","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"12679","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79040","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"259651","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"30444","synopsis":"As school holidays roll in, the girls try and come up with ways to make rakugo more appealing to younger audiences. Later, the gang visit the zoo and discuss the curiosities of all the animals. Afterwards, the gang gets taste for lucky events which keep occurring whenever Marii falls asleep, constantly trying to make her sleep to reap the benefits.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rqP4Hfacs78ClPbEdQiOWggxO3G.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"As school holidays roll in, the girls try and come up with ways to make rakugo more appealing to younger audiences. Later, the gang visit the zoo and discuss the curiosities of all the animals. Afterwards, the gang gets taste for lucky events which keep occurring whenever Marii falls asleep, constantly trying to make her sleep to reap the benefits.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rqP4Hfacs78ClPbEdQiOWggxO3G.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8899","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"12679","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"12679","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79040","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"259651","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"30442","synopsis":"On Halloween, the girls try to tailor the holiday to be more Japanese-esque. Later, the girls visit the Kabukichou entertainment district and observe how it's changed over the years. Afterwards, Marii is plagued with tooth cavities.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6H52PFV7MQKWaFR6LMZbj8SZ1Sm.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"On Halloween, the girls try to tailor the holiday to be more Japanese-esque. Later, the girls visit the Kabukichou entertainment district and observe how it's changed over the years. Afterwards, Marii is plagued with tooth cavities.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6H52PFV7MQKWaFR6LMZbj8SZ1Sm.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8899","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"12679","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"12679","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79040","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"259651","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"30448","synopsis":"As the girls have a fake summer beach trip in the dressing room, they discuss the different designs of school swimsuits. Then, the girls go sightseeing in Musashi-Sakai and pay their respects to the company responsible for animating them. Lastly, the girls have a Christmas party, but the tree that Tetora ordered online completely fills the dressing room, causing them to try and reunite (but end up fighting each other) in the Amazon-like jungle.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bhzIv1iap2F9c56ogude17Ca1eo.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"As the girls have a fake summer beach trip in the dressing room, they discuss the different designs of school swimsuits. Then, the girls go sightseeing in Musashi-Sakai and pay their respects to the company responsible for animating them. Lastly, the girls have a Christmas party, but the tree that Tetora ordered online completely fills the dressing room, causing them to try and reunite (but end up fighting each other) in the Amazon-like jungle.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bhzIv1iap2F9c56ogude17Ca1eo.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8899","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"12679","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"12679","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"79040","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"259651","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"30450","synopsis":"When Tetora asks everyone about their first dream of the new year, Kukuru grows upset as she has yet to have one. So, the girls attempt to act out a \"first dream\" to cheer her up. Later, the gang visits Roppongi, where they look at structural artwork and Marii travels through time to see the city during its economic bubble. Finally, the girls try to cool off during the summer by mentioning scary things to give themselves chills and eventually by painting everything blue.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hBdrhgoRQuI4D0DvZD9skk2vpkN.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 12","synopsis":"When Tetora asks everyone about their first dream of the new year, Kukuru grows upset as she has yet to have one. So, the girls attempt to act out a \"first dream\" to cheer her up. Later, the gang visits Roppongi, where they look at structural artwork and Marii travels through time to see the city during its economic bubble. Finally, the girls try to cool off during the summer by mentioning scary things to give themselves chills and eventually by painting everything blue.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hBdrhgoRQuI4D0DvZD9skk2vpkN.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 13","ep